{'symbol': 'MU', 'date': '2022-07-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'MICRON TO SELECT ATHINIA™ FOR PIONEERING DATA COLLABORATION', 'text': "A LONG-TERM, STRATEGIC, ENTERPRISE-LEVEL TECHNOLOGY COLLABORATION AIMS TO\xa0FURTHER INCREASE PRODUCTION EFFICIENCIES AND REDUCE COSTS FOR MICRON AND ITS SUPPLIERS CAMBRIDGE, MASS. , JULY 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, ATHINIA™\xa0ANNOUNCED THAT MICRON TECHNOLOGY, INC. (NASDAQ: MU), A GLOBAL LEADER IN INNOVATIVE MEMORY AND STORAGE SOLUTIONS, PLANS TO USE THE ATHINIA™ DATA ANALYTICS PLATFORM TO CREATE A PIONEERING DATA COLLABORATION ECOSYSTEM THAT WILL HELP LEAD A CONTINUED JOURNEY OF DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION WITH MICRON'S CRITICAL SUPPLIERS."}